### Tabs default

```jsx
<Tabs aria-label="Account information">
  <TabsPanel title="Summary" key="summary">
    View a summary of your account.
  </TabsPanel>
  <TabsPanel title="Transactions" key="transactions">
    View your recent transactions.
  </TabsPanel>
</Tabs>
```

### Material Tabs

```jsx
<Tabs look="material" color="primary" aria-label="Account information">
  <TabsPanel title="Summary" key="summary">
    View a summary of your account.
  </TabsPanel>
  <TabsPanel title="Transactions" key="transactions">
    View your recent transactions.
  </TabsPanel>
</Tabs>
```

### Lego Tabs

```jsx
<Tabs color="hero" aria-label="Account information">
  <TabsPanel title="Summary" key="summary">
    View a summary of your account.
  </TabsPanel>
  <TabsPanel title="Transactions" key="transactions">
    View your recent transactions.
  </TabsPanel>
</Tabs>
```

### Justified Tabs

```jsx
<Tabs justify aria-label="Account information">
  <TabsPanel title="Summary" key="summary">
    View a summary of your account.
  </TabsPanel>
  <TabsPanel title="Transactions" key="transactions">
    View your recent transactions.
  </TabsPanel>
</Tabs>
```

### Vertical Tabs

```jsx
<Tabs orientation="vertical" aria-label="Account information">
  <TabsPanel title="Summary" key="summary">
    View a summary of your account.
  </TabsPanel>
  <TabsPanel title="Transactions" key="transactions">
    View your recent transactions.
  </TabsPanel>
</Tabs>
```

### Keep tab panels mounted

Use `keepMounted` when content must retain its state after the user changes tabs

```jsx
<Tabs aria-label="Application sections">
  <TabsPanel title="Personal details" key="personal-details" keepMounted>
    Personal details form
  </TabsPanel>
  <TabsPanel title="Contact details" key="contact-details" keepMounted>
    Contact details form
  </TabsPanel>
</Tabs>
```
